Package: PROACT
Type: Package
Title: Prior-Regularized Optimization for Analysis of Co-occurring TFs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dongmei", "Han", email = "handongmei@ucas.ac.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements PROACT, a prior-informed framework for inferring
    candidate cooperative transcription factor associations from chromatin
    accessibility and motif occupancy. The package constructs prior evidence
    matrices, prepares binary peak-by-TF matrices, fits priority LASSO models,
    characterizes spatial motif grammar, and visualizes inferred TF-TF networks.
URL: https://github.com/hdm2020/PROACT
BugReports: https://github.com/hdm2020/PROACT/issues
